                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <DIV class=WordSection1>
<P class=4 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">关于举办第四届全市中小学青年教师</SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=4 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">教学竞赛的方案</SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=NoSpacing1 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: ??_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=1 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">为深入学习贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想和党的十九大精神，落实中共中央、国务院《关于全面深化新时代教师队伍建设改革的意见》，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋">进一步提升我市中小学青年教师的教学能力和业务水平，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">根据浙江省教育厅和教育工会关于举办第三届全省中小学青年教师教学竞赛（以下简称“竞赛”），现将有关事宜通知如下：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=1 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">一、竞赛宗旨<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=1 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black">以锤炼青年教师教学基本功，加强师德师风建设为着力点，充分发挥教学竞赛在提高教师队伍素质中的引领示范作用，弘扬劳模和工匠精神，进一步激发广大中小学青年教师更新教育理念和掌握现代教学方法的热情，努力造就一支有理想信念、有道德情操、有扎实学识、有仁爱之心的高素质、专业化教师队伍，推动我市中小学教育事业现代化。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; tab-stops: 164.25pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black">二、竞赛原则<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-tab-count: 1">     </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=1 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black">坚持公平、公正、公开；坚持广泛参与、层层发动；坚持注重教学基本功和实际应用能力；坚持严谨、规范。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=1 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">三、竞赛学科和参赛对象<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（一）竞赛学科。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">竞赛分为小学组（学科可以从语文、数学、英语任选其一）、中学语文组、中学数学组、中学英语组，共四个组别。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">（二）参赛对象。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">全市从事中小学（含职业高中）教育教学工作的青年教师均可报名。各参赛单位推荐参加竞赛的选手年龄必须在</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">40</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">岁以下（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">1980</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">8</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">31</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体">日后出生）。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black">四、竞赛实施<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋">因新冠肺炎疫情影响，为避免群体性聚集，本次比赛采用<B>云比赛</B>形式，即全体参赛选手采用寄送书面和电子材料方式参赛，具体安排见后文。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">（一）时间、地点<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">竞赛时间初定为<SPAN lang=EN-US>2020</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>月中旬，具体时间和地点另行通知。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">（二）参赛名额<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">各区、县（市）教育局、教育工会每个组别报送<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>名选手，市直有关学校每校选送<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>名（具体见附表<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=3 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">（三）竞赛安排<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">以“上好一门课”为竞赛理念，本次竞赛由教学设计、教学展示两部分组成，分数分别为<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>分、<SPAN lang=EN-US>80</SPAN>分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: black">1</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: black">、教学设计<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">教学设计是指以<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>个学时<SPAN lang=EN-US>45</SPAN>分钟为基本单位，对教学活动的设想与安排。主要包括题目、学情分析、教学目标、教学思想、课程资源、教学内容、教学重点与难点、教学方法与工具、教学安排、教学评价、预习任务与课后作业等。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">选手需准备参赛课程<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">个<SPAN style="COLOR: black">学时的教学设计方案，评委将对整套教学设计方案进行打分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: black">2</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: black">、教学展示<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">教学展示采取“课堂教学<SPAN lang=EN-US>+</SPAN>教学阐释”的形式。课堂教学即现场授课，评委主要从对教材的处理、教学过程与方法、语言教态、教学效果等方面进行考评。教学阐释采取“说课”的形式，应包含教材解读、学情分析、目标定位、基本理念、课程设计、教学重点难点、方法选择等。教学展示内容要与提交的教学设计内容对应、一致。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">教学展示共计<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>分钟，其中课堂教学环节不少于<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>分钟，教学阐释环节不少于<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>分钟，另外<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>分钟时间可由选手在两环节中自行调配。选手完成课堂教学后，随即进入教学阐释环节。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">选手需准备参赛课程</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">个<SPAN style="COLOR: black">学时相对应的</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>个<SPAN style="COLOR: black">教学展示节段的<SPAN lang=EN-US>PPT</SPAN>。每个<SPAN lang=EN-US>PPT</SPAN>文件中应包含 “课堂教学<SPAN lang=EN-US>+</SPAN>教学阐释”两部分内容。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: black">3</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体; COLOR: black">、计分方法<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">教学设计、教学展示两部分具体评分细则分别参见附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>、<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>。统分时去掉一个最高分和一个最低分后的累积分，除以评委人数（不含一个最高分和一个最低分的评委）为选手得分。成绩评定采用百分制，选手两个部分的得分相加为最终得分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">4</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">、注意事项<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）本次竞赛因受新冠肺炎疫情影响，采用选手录好参赛视频并提交有关纸质教案给赛会，赛会组织专家评审方式决出个人名次和团体成绩；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）；选手在教学展示部分以及报名时提交给评委的所有材料（视频、<SPAN lang=EN-US>PPT</SPAN>、教案）中不得出现姓名、学校和市、区、县等任何与个人相关的信息；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）教学展示采取“无生上课”的形式；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）根据各自参赛课程需要，选手可携带教学模型、挂图等；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>）选手对有关教案等内容要注意知识产权保护，赛会方反对利用竞赛窃取选手知识产权行为，拥有对有关窃取行为进一步司法手段的权利；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=5 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>）其他未尽事项由赛事组委会解释说明，赛事组委会拥有最终解释权。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=5>（四）表彰奖励<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">赛后，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">由市教育局、市教育工会</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">根据参赛具体情况确定有关名次和奖励并通报表彰</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">。<SPAN style="COLOR: black">同时，每个组别选送一名选手参加全省竞赛（原则上第一名选手），对参加省赛并代表我省参加国赛的选手，优先作为工会荣誉候选人推荐。同时，竞赛将对组织工作严密，比赛成绩突出的有关代表队按区县市组和市直组分别评选一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>名，二等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>名，三等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>名，</SPAN>由市教育局、市教育工会通报表彰。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=11 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">（五）组队及报名<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">各区、县（市）教育局、教育工会和市直有关学校要高度重视、认真推荐选手参加竞赛。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">报名及材料要求：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">由各地教育工会与学校工会统一报名，截止日期为<SPAN lang=EN-US>2020</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>日。<SPAN style="COLOR: black">材料清单如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">、《第四届全市中小学青年教师教学竞赛参赛选手推荐表》<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>份；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">、《第四届全市中小学青年教师教学竞赛参赛代表队人员汇总表》<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>份；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">竞赛课件材料（具体要求见附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=5>五、组织领导<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">成立</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">第四届全市中小学青年教师教学竞赛组织委员会（以下简称“组委会”），全面负责竞赛的组织筹备、综合协调和监督指导等工作。组委会</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">成员由市总工会、市教育局、市教育工会、承办单位有关负责人等组成。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">同时，聘请有关专家组成评审委员会。<SPAN lang=EN-US style="COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=2 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">各地要加强对教学竞赛的组织领导，积极发动、精心组织、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋">统筹安排，<SPAN style="COLOR: black">确保教学竞赛各项工作的顺利进行。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=3 style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文仿宋">联系人：绍兴市教育工会张建国，电话<SPAN lang=EN-US>85200278</SPAN>，邮箱<SPAN lang=EN-US>249585988@qq.com</SPAN>；材料邮寄地址：绍兴市凤林西路<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>号市职工之家<SPAN lang=EN-US>1910</SPAN>室。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
